1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,758
Welcome to the Graph RAG Literature Platform.

2
00:00:02,758 --> 00:00:07,092
Our goal: turn weeks of trial review into answers in seconds,

3
00:00:07,092 --> 00:00:10,000
starting with SGLT2 studies in kidney disease.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,911
Search PubMed and click Ingest.

5
00:00:11,911 --> 00:00:15,734
Gemini extracts PICO: population, intervention, comparator, outcome, and biomedical entities.

6
00:00:15,734 --> 00:00:18,027
MeSH and UMLS normalization merge synonyms.

7
00:00:18,027 --> 00:00:22,000
Four new papers take the corpus from three to seven.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,137
Studies, drugs, conditions,

9
00:00:23,137 --> 00:00:25,788
and outcomes connect in one knowledge graph.

10
00:00:25,788 --> 00:00:27,683
Explore normalized concepts in NER.

11
00:00:27,683 --> 00:00:30,335
One extraction powers chat, the entity explorer,

12
00:00:30,335 --> 00:00:32,000
and the PICO grid.

13
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,930
Ask: compare SGLT2 studies.

14
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:39,236
Gemini routes across graph traversal, aggregation, vector search, and community summaries,

15
00:00:39,236 --> 00:00:41,166
then synthesizes retrieved evidence.

16
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:45,508
Graph retrieval targets every study linked to matching concepts,

17
00:00:45,508 --> 00:00:50,000
addressing the completeness gaps of a small vector-search sample.

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,294
Compare trials in the PICO grid,

19
00:00:52,294 --> 00:00:54,587
with effect sizes and confidence intervals.

20
00:00:54,587 --> 00:00:59,939
The P value of point two one is not statistically significant. Keep it visible,

21
00:00:59,939 --> 00:01:02,000
and export evidence for review.

22
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,072
Every claim links to a verbatim source sentence.

23
00:01:05,072 --> 00:01:11,600
The system aims to eliminate hallucinated extractions by rejecting fields whose quote is absent from the paper.

24
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:18,000
Experts open the original source and verify the evidence before using an answer.

25
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,232
For R and D, medical affairs, and regulatory teams,

26
00:01:21,232 --> 00:01:24,464
the goal is weeks of review condensed into minutes,

27
00:01:24,464 --> 00:01:26,977
with complete connected evidence and traceable answers.

28
00:01:26,977 --> 00:01:30,000
Graph RAG Literature Platform: evidence you can trust.
